      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Kayle's attacks are empowered by the heavens as she levels up and spends skill points. Her wings are lit aflame as she progressively gains Attack Speed, Move Speed, Attack Range, and waves of fire on her attacks.",
      "summary_zh": "凯尔的攻击会随着她提升等级和分配技能点而获得增强。她的羽翼将燃起圣焰，逐步提供攻击速度，移动速度，攻击距离，以及攻击附带焰浪。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1388325:4051190"
